          </fieldset>
          <fieldset class="q" data-layer="Machinery" data-def="Intake, booking and follow-up. The systems that run the world." data-fix="If it runs on you, it stops when you do. Automate intake, booking and follow-up.">
            <legend><span class="q__layer">7 · Machinery</span><span class="sr-only">Machinery: Intake, booking and follow-up. The systems that run the world.</span><span class="q__text">Do intake, booking, follow-up and reporting run without you chasing them?</span></legend>
